# Wrangler / OpenNext local Workers preview secrets (repo root).
# Copy:  cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
# Names only — never commit real values. .dev.vars and .dev.vars.* are gitignored.

# Required for admin login and protected /api routes in `pnpm preview`.
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# Optional. Omit for same-origin /api (default on Workers).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
